# Mission IG Follower

An AI-powered personal Instagram content automation platform.

## Status

🚧 Under Development

## Current Sprint

Sprint 2 - Product Design

## Repository Structure

```
backend/
frontend/
automation/
ai/
docs/
scripts/
assets/
tests/
```

## Vision

Build a personal AI assistant that helps create high-quality Instagram content, organize content, assist with publishing workflows, and provide analytics to improve organic growth.

## Roadmap

- Sprint 1 - Foundation ✅
- Sprint 2 - Product Design 🚧
- Sprint 3 - UI Design
- Sprint 4 - Backend
- Sprint 5 - AI Engine
- Sprint 6 - Content Studio
- Sprint 7 - Publishing Workflow
- Sprint 8 - Analytics